<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/business.css"></head><body><%- include('../partials/admin_header') %><main class="studio-admin"><h1>SEO Planning</h1><p>1,000 keyword ideas in 20 clusters. These are planning ideas, not measured search volumes or ranking promises. Validate demand and business relevance before writing a page. City ideas do not imply an office or service location.</p><p>Use a small, relevant subset naturally on each page. Never publish this entire list as page text or meta keywords.</p><p><a href="/admin/settings/website">Edit page SEO titles and descriptions</a> · <a href="/admin/products">Edit product SEO</a> · <a href="/admin/seo/keywords.csv">Download all keyword ideas (CSV)</a></p><form method="get" class="studio-form"><label>Cluster<select name="cluster"><option value="">All clusters</option><% clusters.forEach(name=>{ %><option <%= cluster===name?'selected':'' %>><%= name %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Search<input name="q" value="<%= q %>" maxlength="100"></label><button>Filter</button></form><p><%= rows.length %> ideas</p><div class="studio-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Cluster</th><th>Keyword idea</th><th>Intent</th><th>Suggested page</th></tr></thead><tbody><% rows.forEach(row=>{ %><tr><td><%= row.cluster %></td><td><%= row.keyword %></td><td><%= row.intent %></td><td><%= row.target_page %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div></main></body></html>
